OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA grey start, with outbreaks of
OL,6,Flight rain or drizzle in places. The
OL,7,Fcloud slowly clears south during the
OL,8,Fafternoon, with sunny spells to
OL,9,Ffollow. Light winds, but breezier
OL,10,Falong the coast during the morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClear spells overnight, with
OL,13,Fa light breeze. Feeling cooler than on
OL,14,Fprevious nights, with a frost possible
OL,15,Fin rural areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
