OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA clear and still start to the
OL,6,Fday, clouding over throughout the
OL,7,Fmorning with perhaps a few showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping by the evening.
OL,9,FTemperatures around normal for the
OL,10,Ftime of year.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FHigh
OL,13,Fpressure continues to dominate in the
OL,14,Fcoming days, bringing generally cloudy
OL,15,Fbut largely dry conditions, with a
OL,16,Fgentle easterly breeze. Temperatures
OL,17,Fremain around normal for the time of
OL,18,Fyear.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
